          "reason": "On May 28, 2025 Synopsys reaffirmed its full fiscal year 2025 revenue guidance ($6,745-$6,805M), while on May 29, 2025 Synopsys announced it suspended its financial guidance for full fiscal year 2025 in connection with the BIS Letter. This is a direction/basis change rather than a same-proposition contradiction of the numeric range; reported vs suspended guidance on the same period.",
